      "longBusinessSummary": "Ideanomics, Inc., through its subsidiaries, provides various mobility solutions in Asia, Europe, and the United States. The company's Ideanomics Mobility business unit operates as an end-to-end solutions provider for the procurement, financing, charging, and energy management needs for fleet operators of commercial electric vehicles (EVs). It also offers high-power inductive charging solutions for medium and heavy-duty EVs. The company's Ideanomics Capital fintech business unit focuses on leveraging technology and innovation to improve efficiency, transparency, and profitability for the financial services industry. The company was formerly known as Seven Stars Cloud Group, Inc. and changed its name to Ideanomics, Inc. in October 2018. Ideanomics, Inc. was incorporated in 2004 and is headquartered in New York, New York. On December 4, 2024, Ideanomics, Inc. along with its affiliates, filed a voluntary petition for reorganization under Chapter 11 in the U.S. Bankruptcy Court for the District of Delaware.",
